From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] animation: construct the drag icon with `new`

Gtk.DragIcon.get_for_drag is a named constructor in the GTK 4.24 Vala API
used with valac 0.56. Construct it with `new` so the call compiles.
---
--- a/src/animation/drag_lift.vala
+++ b/src/animation/drag_lift.vala
@@ -97,7 +97,7 @@
             if (!use_icon || item.get_width() <= 0) return;
             var bin = build_icon(item);
             _icon_bin = bin;
-            var icon = Gtk.DragIcon.get_for_drag(drag) as Gtk.DragIcon;
+            var icon = new Gtk.DragIcon.get_for_drag(drag) as Gtk.DragIcon;
             if (icon == null) return;
             icon.child = bin;
             double x = _press_x, y = _press_y;
